# Parser pipeline

Flow: Google Doc → `src/parser/` → `src/parser/output/compound-places.json` → GCS or `public/` (when GCS disabled).

Required env: `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `GOOGLE_DOC_ID`, `GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY` (see `config.js`).

- Run: `npm run parse` from `app/`
- Debug fixture: `src/parser/fixtures/example-input.md`
- House mechanics output: GCS or `fixtures/house-mechanics/` for local dev

Do not put guest-only markdown in `public/`. See [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../app/documentation/ARCHITECTURE.md).
